							<STRONG>About GuildPortal</STRONG><BR>
								<BR>
								GuildPortal is developed and operated by Axiom Shift, LLC, founded by Aaron and 
								Sandra Lewis.&nbsp; It was started as a hosting service specifically for guilds 
								playing MMOGs (massively multiplayer online games).
							</P>
							<P><STRONG>Mission<BR>
								</STRONG>
								<BR>
								Our mission is to provide the very best in community hosting services.</P>
							<P><STRONG>GuildPortal Service<BR>
								</STRONG>
								<BR>
								Using modular community design and cutting-edge technology, GuildPortal is 
								designed from the ground up to give guilds the features they want, 
								customizability that surpasses any other managed hosting environment, and 
								ease-of-use that saves hundreds of hours when compared to developing your own 
								site with similar functionality.</P>
							<P><STRONG>GuildPortal Team</STRONG><BR>
								&nbsp;<BR>
								Aaron Michael Lewis, Founder<BR>
								Sandra Anne Lewis, Founder<BR></P>
							<P><STRONG>Corporate Financing</STRONG><BR>
								&nbsp;<BR>
								Axiom Shift, founded in 2001, is a self-funded, privately held Limited 
								Liability (LLC) corporation.</P>
							<P><STRONG>Trademarks</STRONG><BR>
								&nbsp;<BR>
								GuildPortal, The Leader in Guild Hosting, and Get Your Guild Online! are trademarks of Axiom Shift, LLC.<BR>
								<BR>
								<STRONG>Contact Us</STRONG><BR>
								&nbsp;<BR>
								GuildPortal is located in Aurora, Colorado, with managed data centers in Cedar 
								Falls, Iowa.&nbsp; To learn more about Axiom Shift, please 
								visit our web site at <A href="http://www.axiomshift.com">www.AxiomShift.com</A>
								or call us at (303)680-5428.</P>
							<p><strong>Infrastructure</strong><br><br>
							To provide you with the very best in services, GuildPortal has fully dedicated web 
							and database servers provided by <a href="http://www.rackspace.com">RackSpace</a>, the industry leader in hosted solutions.  
							Their 100% uptime guarantee (excluding scheduled maintenance), rapid response in the case of 
							hardware failure, and standard-setting support put GuildPortal at the forefront of all community 
							hosting solutions where it matters the most and where you see it the least -- behind the scenes.
							</p>
							<P><STRONG>Support</STRONG><BR>
								&nbsp;<BR>
								For technical support, or questions/feedback about the GuildPortal service, 
								please contact:<BR>
								<A href="mailto:development@guildportal.com">development@guildportal.com</A></P>
							<P><STRONG>Marketing<BR>
								</STRONG>&nbsp;<BR>
								For questions regarding marketing, advertising and promotions, please contact:<BR>
								<A href="mailto:aaronlewis@guildportal.com">aaronlewis@guildportal.com</A></P>
							<P><STRONG>Public Relations<BR>
